{%- comment -%}
  Where a product card's link and button should go.

  Everything goes to its own product page, except a gift card, which goes to
  /pages/gift-vouchers. That page is the only place the amount, the delivery
  method, the recipient and the send date are collected, and those become the
  line item properties Shopify reads to issue the voucher. A card that linked
  to the gift card's own product page would let a shopper add a voucher with
  none of them, and Shopify would quietly issue it to the buyer.

  Pairs with product-restricted.liquid, which stops the one-click add on the
  same products. Change one and change the other.

  Usage: <a href="{% render 'product-card-url', product: product %}">
  Accepts: product (required)
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if product.gift_card? -%}/pages/gift-vouchers{%- else -%}{{ product.url }}{%- endif -%}
